### API Surface Bootstrap Syntax

#### formats function parameters without parser-fragile lambda match

- Verify: formats function parameters without parser-fragile lambda match


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 11 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: formats function parameters without parser-fragile lambda match")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val layered = source("src/compiler/90.tools/api_surface.spl")
val flat = source("src/compiler/tools/api_surface.spl")

expect(layered).to_contain("var param_parts: [text] = []")
expect(layered).to_contain("for param in sig.params:")
expect(layered).to_not_contain("sig.params.map(\\param:")
expect(flat).to_contain("var param_parts: [text] = []")
expect(flat).to_contain("for param in sig.params:")
expect(flat).to_not_contain("sig.params.map(\\param:")
```

</details>

